# Backend (Supabase)

- New schema = new migration under `supabase/migrations/`. Never edit applied migrations.
- Every client-readable table needs RLS (anon key is public in the WebView).
- Stripe secrets and payment state updates stay in Edge Functions (`create-checkout`, `payments-webhook`). Client does not mark orders paid.
- Single merchant — no Stripe Connect.
- Transactional templates: add under `functions/_shared/transactional-email-templates/` and register in `registry.ts`.
- After schema changes, update generated `src/integrations/supabase/types.ts` for the affected tables only.
